<title>BRAZIL: Brazil July 18 coffee regs 2.79 mln bags to Sept.</title>
<headline>Brazil July 18 coffee regs 2.79 mln bags to Sept.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee sales registrations as of July 18 totaled 2.79 million 60-kg bags for July, August and September, according to the July 25 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>Of this, 1.26 million bags were registered for July.</p>
<p>The breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REG 60-KG BAGS-July 18    REG 60-KG BAGS-July 11</p>
<p> July		   1,259,550		1,389,174</p>
<p> August		 1,083,452		  790,584</p>
<p> September		451,453		  389,110</p>
<p> TOTAL		  2,794,455		2,568,868</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
